# ONE CLASS A DEED (an ended guard of a name stays ended, so a run of deeds on one class asks the guard once). Each function reads its own class's method off the prototype and calls it behind the guard; three calls as written;
# then code that nobody sees does one deed to that class; three calls more. As plain. f9 = use1 .. f16 = use8
